---baseUrl=http://localhost:8080/api

### Create
curl -X POST $baseUrl/workflows
-H "Content-Type: application/json"
-d
{
  "statuses": [
    { "name": "Draft" },
    { "name": "Completed" }
  ]
}

### Find All
curl -X GET $baseUrl/workflows

### Find by Id
---findUUID=b1a71a96-01b1-4df7-ae58-8ac40b22a60b
curl -X GET $baseUrl/workflows/$findUUID
